WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.214
He finally died--

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:15.598
This is Magmell's true terror.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:20.186
It amplifies the greed
and hatred within humans.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.856
You killed your parents.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.109
You killed your allies.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.903
In the end,
you even killed your little brother.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:30.947
You bastard!

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.950
There's only one way to save you!

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:37.245
I'll turn you into Epona fertilizer, too!

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:45.712
That's a nice feeling!

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:09.944
Damn it!

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:14.908
Lachter?

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:16.451
Yeah!

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.162
Once I'm cured, I want to be a Lachter!

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.623
Not an explorer?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:25.001
I'll become a Lachter and help you out!

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:27.087
You dummy.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:29.672
Lachters are just an old folk tale.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.467
Lachter!

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.968
I'll save you!

